epetitive automations\"</blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Product 6 -->\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/agmsg\" target=\"_blank\">agmsg</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Stop copy-pasting between your AI coding agents. An open-source CLI tool that lets Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, and Copilot CLI message each other directly.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI workflow tool</span>\n                            <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                            <span class=\"date\">2026-06-08</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quotes\">\n                            <blockquote>\"Direct agent-to-agent messaging between different AI coding tools\"</blockquote>\n                            <blockquote>\"Shared SQLite database for message passing\"</blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Product 7 -->\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://www.zot.sh\" target=\"_blank\">Zot</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            A lightweight, single-binary coding agent harness written in Go. Supports multiple providers, built-in tools, swarm mode, and a built-in Telegram bridge.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                            <span class=\"source\">Show HN</span>\